 </table><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0;">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;">(The accompanying notes are an integral part of
these condensed interim consolidated financial statements)</p>
